    <string name="settings_section_privacy">Privacy &amp; limits</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">The camera runs only on the send and receive screens and turns itself off. Hand tracking runs fully on your phone, and files go only to the phone whose code you confirmed. No servers, no internet.</string>
    <string name="settings_limits_body">Honestly: Android does not allow an always-on background camera, Kaff works between Android phones only, and the gesture is a trigger, not an identity check. Security comes from the pairing code and the Accept step.</string>

